      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/437d28efdf55f269d59b0e99b949b7eb.webp?t=1767885515\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos at the headquarters of the video game organization, UPIXO: the villain, El Pix, has stolen some important and historically valuable artifacts of video game history from the archive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Chubby retrieve all the artifacts from El Pix's icy realm of Snowdriftland!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/a1e1f93fc15d192876cb8e7452315e40.poster.avif?t=1767885515\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/a1e1f93fc15d192876cb8e7452315e40.webm?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/a1e1f93fc15d192876cb8e7452315e40.mp4?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/38a48544aa81f2c4786dc1a1e4dae448.webp?t=1767885515\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission in Snowdriftland is unique in its concept: Play it like a traditional Advent calendar, and select a level every day and let Chubby guide you through the cold winter days. Or play it like a classic platformer - any time you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/899dff6ecaf666e56828de41a8070df1.poster.avif?t=1767885515\" width=780 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/899dff6ecaf666e56828de41a8070df1.webm?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/899dff6ecaf666e56828de41a8070df1.mp4?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/ed83a66e9f21e8d10baede92c1e22c73.webp?t=1767885515\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission in Snowdriftland offers the right gaming experience for all players: younger and less experienced gamers can get off to a quick and easy start and jump right in to start searching for the artifacts, while core gamers will face a cool challenge as they collect all snowflakes per level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/8060887bda51beef2da77ffd63cef546.poster.avif?t=1767885515\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/8060887bda51beef2da77ffd63cef546.webm?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/8060887bda51beef2da77ffd63cef546.mp4?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/a4880c750f48bfc676b04bf94d75fcfb.webp?t=1767885515\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to confront some wacky enemies like penguins in squirrel costumes, polar bear joggers listening to music, flaming fire bumblebees and many more.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/7858249f02545e8ac1df3efbb13275b3.poster.avif?t=1767885515\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/7858249f02545e8ac1df3efbb13275b3.webm?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/7858249f02545e8ac1df3efbb13275b3.mp4?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/9b6675c8230724c8ca59e65bd567b9fa.poster.avif?t=1767885515\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/9b6675c8230724c8ca59e65bd567b9fa.webm?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/9b6675c8230724c8ca59e65bd567b9fa.mp4?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/b9befd2e76c93124ae09f306f0378b75.webp?t=1767885515\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against four Minibosses, the subordinates of El Pix, who are standing in your way after every world. Defeat them to prove that you can face the big boss himself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/b7fe1d6a7f5d7845cc7764ebfe1b9e1c.poster.avif?t=1767885515\" width=616 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/b7fe1d6a7f5d7845cc7764ebfe1b9e1c.webm?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/b7fe1d6a7f5d7845cc7764ebfe1b9e1c.mp4?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/af332069905ad38495d15ff1dcf0fe46.poster.avif?t=1767885515\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/af332069905ad38495d15ff1dcf0fe46.webm?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/af332069905ad38495d15ff1dcf0fe46.mp4?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/f5fdf750e722def5a12a64bcf5d42a2c.webp?t=1767885515\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Secret Areas containing strange Glitch Pixels in every level. Collect them all to solve the secret behind the odd Pixel Mass found in the newly discovered Hole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/ff32df95fba4e9ac795a1f2508e01c93.poster.avif?t=1767885515\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/ff32df95fba4e9ac795a1f2508e01c93.webm?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/ff32df95fba4e9ac795a1f2508e01c93.mp4?t=1767885515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515200/extras/d886abe1029235bdda4d5a756f51c251.webp?t=1767885515\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various, entertaining levels in 4 different Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant (truly giant!) unlockable Bonus Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre unlockable Glitch Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging final boss fight against the villainous &quot;El Pix&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini boss battles in each world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements<br><br>Coming soon:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges, Highscore lists and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chubby is on another mission...<i>will you join him?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop